  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "About this space<br><br>Welcome to 'Palms by the Sea' in the brand new luxury community of Twin Palms! Walking distance to shops, restaurants, 30A and more!<br><br>GULF VIEWS from the rooftop terrace with private hot tub, dining table, outdoor furniture with TV and more!<br><br>6-Seater LSV/golf cart, 4 bikes included complimentary! Community pool inclusive access!<br><br>BRAND NEW beach home with tons of space to spread out or come together! A vacation dream!<br><br>The space<br><br>HOME HIGHLIGHTS:<br>-6-Seater LSV/golf cart included (these rent for ~$150/day)<br>-4 bikes provided complimentary<br>-Rooftop terrace with outdoor furniture and dining table, TV, living space, and HOT TUB with GULF VIEWS!!<br>-Multiple balconies<br>-Community pool great for after the beach!<br>-Brand new, open concept floor plan with designer furnishing and top-of-the-line finishes (quartz counters, stainless steel appliances, etc!)<br>-5 Bedrooms + 4 full bathrooms + 1 half bathroom<br>-Electric fireplace<br>-Office nook<br>-Free WiFi<br>-TVs in all bedrooms and living areas<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS: (SLEEPS 14 + 2 on a provided air mattress if needed)<br><br>FIRST FLOOR:<br>-Guest Bedroom 1 - Queen bed and bathroom with glass shower<br>-Living space with Queen-sized sleeper sofa<br><br>SECOND FLOOR:<br>-Main living space, kitchen, dining room, balcony<br>-Office nook<br>-Half bathroom<br><br>THIRD FLOOR:<br>-Master Bedroom 2 - King bed with en-suite bathroom with dual vanities, glass shower and private balcony access<br>-Guest Bedroom 3 - Queen bed and shared bathroom with shower/tub combination and private balcony access<br>-Guest Bedroom 4 - Queen bed and shared bathroom with shower/tub combination<br>-Guest Bedroom 5 - Twin-over-Full bunk bed and Twin XL trundle with en-suite bathroom with glass shower<br><br>There is also a Queen-size air mattress and pack n' play provided at no additional charge.<br><br>Guest access<br><br>Spot for one car in the garage and two cars on in the driveway in addition to the LSV/golf cart. EV Charger available in the garage for electric car charging on the go!<br><br>Located less than a half-mile from the property, the new Highway 98 Underpass makes it easy to bike directly to Highway 30A without having to cross busy roads! This art-filled pathway, featuring vibrant murals and sculptures, is both a safe and scenic way for guests looking to explore the area!<br><br>Other things to note<br>-Check in is 4:00 PM & check out is 10:00 AM. Late check out / early check in will be subject to another day's rental fees.<br>-Smoking is strictly prohibited.<br>-All renters must be over 25 years of age, or if under age 25 must be accompanied by a parent/legal guardian.<br>-LSV/golf cart is not to be driven past the town of Seagrove to the East, or to the West, or on Highway 98. Resolving any issue from the LSV/golf cart battery dying because of the renters not charging it will be charged to the renters.<br>-We provide a starter set of supplies such as toilet paper, paper towels, trash bags, dishwasher + laundry pods for your stay.<br>-Damage that occurs will be collected from the renters.<br>-Southern Holiday Homes can not be held liable for any damage or injury to any persons caused by LSV/golf cart, bikes, hot tub or other amenities provided to guests.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Gulf Views from Rooftop with Hot Tub! LSV/Golf Cart & Bikes Included!"
        }
      ],
