            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for your wonderful review! We’re thrilled to hear that you enjoyed the home, the rooftop area, and the hot tub, as well as the convenient location near the beach, shops, and Rosemary. It’s great to know you appreciated the cleanliness and decor, and we’re so glad you had a fantastic stay. We’d love to welcome you back anytime!",
