            "id": "4287fad6-889e-486c-b0ee-a63dc4744ef7",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for your kind and thoughtful review! We're so glad to hear the home exceeded your expectations and that you enjoyed the space — especially the rooftop and main floor.\n\nWe appreciate your patience with the minor hiccups, and we’re happy our team was able to respond quickly and get everything resolved for you. It’s always our goal to make sure our guests feel taken care of throughout their stay.\n\nThank you again for staying with us, and we’d love to host you again anytime!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Listing was accurate, main floor and rooftop even larger/nicer than the photos show. Crossing the highway was busier than expected, but the use of property provided bikes and LSV was helpful for that. Still some construction in the neighborhood, but only mildly dusty. We had to reach out to the property manager for a few things (hot tub breaker blew, pool was showing closed but wasn’t, and batteries dead in fans/lights) and they were quick to respond and resolve everything. New and spacious.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
